{"pageid":1440,"title":"Elevator","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Elevator</span>","revid":18464,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i><big>\"Allows you to lift up players, cars, and items! If an item is moving on the elevator, it will weld until the final is reached. That way you can make elevators drop stuff when fully extended! \"</big></i>\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Elevator</h2>\n\n\t<div class=\"pi-image-collection wds-tabber\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<li role=\"tab\" id=\"pi-tab-6a97d8703d292-0\" class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" aria-controls=\"pi-tabpanel-6a97d8703d292-0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUnboxed\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<li role=\"tab\" id=\"pi-tab-6a97d8703d292-1\" class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" aria-controls=\"pi-tabpanel-6a97d8703d292-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBoxed\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"pi-tabpanel-6a97d8703d292-0\" aria-labelledby=\"pi-tab-6a97d8703d292-0\">\n\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d0/Elevator.png/revision/latest?cb=20230730051653\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Unboxed\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d0/Elevator.png/revision/latest?cb=20230730051653\" srcset=\"https://