\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater Island</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Illumine Designs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$3,200</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Allows you to lift up players, cars, and items</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Elevator</b> is a structure purchasable from <a href=\"/wiki/Illumine_Designs\" title=\"Illumine Designs\">Illumine Designs</a> for $3,200.\n</p><p>Status can be changed manually by clicking E on it, to raise up or down.\nMax. size is 48 x 48 x 200 studs,<br />min. size is 1x1x4 studs.<br />At maximum size, elevator can lift up to infinite studs (need verify, since players now has basement). When it is at the bottom, it is 1 stud high. Y (up) axis in scaling shows final upper position. <br />The set speed shows as a number when hovering over the elevator itself.\n</p><p>If you use a <a href=\"/wiki/Interactor\" title=\"Interactor\">Interactor</a>, you can trigger the elevator with logic items like a <a href=\"/wiki/Button\" title=\"Button\">Button</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Pressure_Pad\" title=\"Pressure Pad\">Pressure Pad</a> or etc.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"7916a71f0ba89e4cbd0b9ea5138f54f3\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:151px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"ElevatorGUI-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:149px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:ElevatorGUI.png\" title=\"ElevatorGUI.png (92 KB)\" style=\"height:149px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/48/ElevatorGUI.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230730054325\" title=\"ElevatorGUI.png (92 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"The Elevator GUI\" height=\"149\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"ElevatorGUI.png\" data-image-key=\"ElevatorGUI.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"The Elevator GUI\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"ElevatorGUI.png (92 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"The Elevator GUI\" height=\"149\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"ElevatorGUI.png\" data-image-key=\"ElevatorGUI.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"The Elevator GUI\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/48/ElevatorGUI.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230730054325\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">The Elevator GUI</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:151px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"ElevatorFullyExtended-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:95px; width:185px; top:27px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:ElevatorFullyExtended.png\" title=\"ElevatorFullyExtended.png (583 KB)\" style=\"height:95px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/15/ElevatorFullyExtended.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230730061604\" title=\"ElevatorFullyExtended.png (583 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Maximum size, extended\" height=\"149\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"ElevatorFullyExtended.png\" data-image-key=\"ElevatorFullyExtended.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Maximum size, extended\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"ElevatorFullyExtended.png (583 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Maximum size, extended\" height=\"149\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"ElevatorFullyExtended.png\" data-image-key=\"ElevatorFullyExtended.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Maximum size, extended\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/15/ElevatorFullyExtended.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230730061604\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Maximum size, extended</div></div><div class=\"